      "updated": 1790467200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ITEM01  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. New prescription details from\n        your visit require your review: Reply STOP to opt-out\nITEM02  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. One more step for your new\n        prescription. The details require your review:\n        Reply STOP to opt-out\nITEM03  Hi, new prescription details require your review:\n        Reply STOP to opt-out\nITEM04  Hi, Dr. {NAME} wrote you a new prescription. The details\n        require your review: Reply STOP to opt-out\nITEM05  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. For privacy, you'll confirm it's\n        you. New prescription details require your review:\n        Reply STOP to opt-out\nITEM06  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. You can check for savings on\n        your new prescription. The details require your review:\n        Reply STOP to opt-out",
      "originalText": "ITEM01  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. New prescription details from\n        your visit require your review: Reply STOP to opt-out\nITEM02  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. One more step for your new\n        prescription. The details require your review:\n        Reply STOP to opt-out\nITEM03  Hi, new prescription details require your review:\n        Reply STOP to opt-out\nITEM04  Hi, Dr. {NAME} wrote you a new prescription. The details\n        require your review: Reply STOP to opt-out\nITEM05  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. For privacy, you'll confirm it's\n        you. New prescription details require your review:\n        Reply STOP to opt-out\nITEM06  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. You can check for savings on\n        your new prescription. The details require your review:\n        Reply STOP to opt-out",
