      "updated": 1790467200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Picture       →  the text bubble the patient gets, not a phone render\nSize          →  characters out of 140, with {NAME} counted as 6\nCompare       →  side by side with salience, the round 1 winner\nDelivery      →  a word-for-word list; Markdown for Confluence; CSV\nBoard level   →  six audiences, one table per folder, one CSV of 56",
      "originalText": "Picture       →  the text bubble the patient gets, not a phone render\nSize          →  characters out of 140, with {NAME} counted as 6\nCompare       →  side by side with salience, the round 1 winner\nDelivery      →  a word-for-word list; Markdown for Confluence; CSV\nBoard level   →  six audiences, one table per folder, one CSV of 56",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
