      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "# Prescription review SMS for all patients · Design Items\n## ITEM06 · Offer a chance to check savings\ntype: sms · audience: all patients · job: prescription review\ngoal: Keep salience and add one honest line that the patient can check …\nstance: generate · basis: evidence-informed · mode: theory-driven\nexpected: … so it beats salience on click and on authentication.\nevidence:\n- handoff · …/1-F-full/FW02-what-to-explore/FW02-what-to-explore.md\n- evidence · …/1-F-full/FI01-funnel-fundamentals/FI01-funnel-fundamentals.md\n- avoid · …/1-F-full/FK03-no-generative-rule/FK03-no-generative-rule.md\nacceptance:\n- ≤ 140 characters including the opt-out suffix\n- offers savings only as something to check, with no dollar amount, percent or promise\n- never uses the word 'free'",
      "originalText": "# Prescription review SMS for all patients · Design Items\n## ITEM06 · Offer a chance to check savings\ntype: sms · audience: all patients · job: prescription review\ngoal: Keep salience and add one honest line that the patient can check …\nstance: generate · basis: evidence-informed · mode: theory-driven\nexpected: … so it beats salience on click and on authentication.\nevidence:\n- handoff · …/1-F-full/FW02-what-to-explore/FW02-what-to-explore.md\n- evidence · …/1-F-full/FI01-funnel-fundamentals/FI01-funnel-fundamentals.md\n- avoid · …/1-F-full/FK03-no-generative-rule/FK03-no-generative-rule.md\nacceptance:\n- ≤ 140 characters including the opt-out suffix\n- offers savings only as something to check, with no dollar amount, percent or promise\n- never uses the word 'free'",
