      "text": "result.yaml\n  producer: reviewer-claude-07 · verdict: pass\n  target: rd23_generate_item06\nchecks.yaml\n  r01 pass  136 characters, 4 to spare\n  r02 pass  ends 'Reply STOP to opt-out', once\n  r03 pass  '{NAME}' once, in the greeting\n  r04 pass  no drug, condition or dose\n  r05 pass  'can check for': an option, not an outcome\n  r06 pass  no 'free', in any case\nreview.md\n  Clear on first read: three short sentences, one ask at the colon.",
      "originalText": "result.yaml\n  producer: reviewer-claude-07 · verdict: pass\n  target: rd23_generate_item06\nchecks.yaml\n  r01 pass  136 characters, 4 to spare\n  r02 pass  ends 'Reply STOP to opt-out', once\n  r03 pass  '{NAME}' once, in the greeting\n  r04 pass  no drug, condition or dose\n  r05 pass  'can check for': an option, not an outcome\n  r06 pass  no 'free', in any case\nreview.md\n  Clear on first read: three short sentences, one ask at the colon.",
