      "seed": 320254183,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 443233999,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790467200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. A person releases the Commission; an agent runs only what is queued.\n2. Verify is a different agent in a fresh context; it can fail a draft or send a note.\n3. A review note or a failed rule becomes feedback on a new Generate; old drafts stay.\n4. Each SMS is judged on its own rules: length, the STOP line, {NAME}, no health detail.\n5. The Board level lists the six audiences; one CSV holds all 56 designs.",
      "originalText": "1. A person releases the Commission; an agent runs only what is queued.\n2. Verify is a different agent in a fresh context; it can fail a draft or send a note.\n3. A review note or a failed rule becomes feedback on a new Generate; old drafts stay.\n4. Each SMS is judged on its own rules: length, the STOP line, {NAME}, no health detail.\n5. The Board level lists the six audiences; one CSV holds all 56 designs.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
